x86_64-windows  two guards cxx1 writes and clang does not: ?built@?$C@H@@2ULoud@@A$guard and ?other@?$C@H@@2HA$guard. A template's static member initialised before main is guarded by a weak flag beside the object, where clang and cl use a COMDAT initialiser function ml64 cannot mark - the difference template-static-data-member-ctor.nonames records. Both Itanium targets agree on all 13 names, the two _ZGV guards included.
